Z||000000||kempo||10-10-2001||05:10 PM||||I am wondering where you all shift for to maxamize the performance you get out of your v6 fiero.  Of course, you would want to stay where the torque curve is, and away from the redline, as there is no power up there.  If racing the stock v6, with a 5 speed tranny, where should you shift to get the most performance?  Also, what rpm do you shift at when you're just cruising?||||reg||1
