Z||000002||88formula||10-10-2001||09:24 PM||||I shifted at 5200-5400 RPM when racing and 2500 when just cruising. <P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/88formula_logo_1.JPG"> ||||reg||1
Z||000003||Alex4mula||10-10-2001||09:35 PM||||In a manual I heard that in 1st you shift so that 2nd starts at or near you peak torque RPM. That many times will be 6K. In my auto I reduced .3s manual shifting at 6K with a 2k start.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> Have not been so lucky in my stick shift car  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>------------------<BR>    Alex4mula<BR>:) Red & White (:||||reg||1
